      "task_id": "JUSO-WEB-OS-001",
      "instruction": "I need to verify an address location and document the postal code for administrative purposes. Could you please find the exact postal code for the address '서울특별시 종로구 세종대로 175' on the Road Address System (juso.go.kr), then open text.txt in ProzillaOS and record the result in the format 'Postal Code: [value]'?",
